                                                                Business Question  
Which customers are repeatedly involved in fraudulent transactions?
Which customers have repeated fraudulent transactions, and what proportion and value of their transactions are fraudulent?


                                                              Query
SELECT
    customer,
	category,
    SUM(CASE
        WHEN fraud = 1 THEN 1
        ELSE 0
    END) AS fraudulent_transactions,
    ROUND(
        SUM(CASE
            WHEN fraud = 1 THEN amount
            ELSE 0
        END),2) AS fraudulent_transaction_value
FROM fraud_detection_data
GROUP BY customer,category
ORDER BY fraudulent_transactions DESC;


